OL,3,GNEWSAWomen to advise mayor how to make
OL,4,ALondon safer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe opinions of women and girls will be
OL,7,Fsought on how to improve the safety of
OL,8,Fpublic spaces across London as part of
OL,9,Fa scheme aimed at tackling violence and
OL,10,Fmisogyny.
OL,12,FUnder the Mayor of London Sir Sadiq
OL,13,FKhan's "first-ever new fund", community
OL,14,Fresearch teams will gather views and
OL,15,Fhelp to audit public places to make
OL,16,Fthem safer, with potential suggestions
OL,17,Flikely to include improved CCTV and
OL,18,Fbetter lighting.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
