OL,3,GNEWSAWomen to advise mayor how to make
OL,4,ALondon safer
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal authorities in London will be
OL,7,Fable to apply for a share of #15.6m,
OL,8,Fwhich is part of a wider investment of
OL,9,Fmore than #37m.
OL,11,FSusan Hall, leader of the City Hall
OL,12,FConservative Group, has said the
OL,13,Fpriority should be preventing women
OL,14,Fbecoming victims in the first place and
OL,15,Fmore police funding.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
